pack.决定 AI 对话默认怎么分流:\n· 本地优先(省钱):简单操作用本地小模型,复:
Choose how AI conversations are routed by default:
· Local First (Cost-saving): Use the local small model for simple operations, automatically switch to cloud for complex tasks;
· Cloud First (More powerful): All tasks use the cloud-based large model (requires internet connection; will downgrade automatically if no cloud is configured);
· Hybrid (Balanced): Route based on rules + model review for a balanced use of local and cloud resources.
⚠️ The local small model cannot understand vague/abstract requests (such as "find a mod by function"); such tasks rely on the cloud by default. For a stable experience where you can easily find whatever you want, it is recommended to use "Cloud First/Hybrid".

pack.怎么选:\n· 和朋友联机,但大家**不在同一个 WiFi**(分布全国)→ «:
How to choose:
· To play multiplayer with friends who are **not on the same WiFi** (spread across the country) → use "Virtual LAN" (such as EasyTier); **no need to be on the same physical WiFi/router**;
· If everyone is **on the same WiFi/router** (e.g., in the same room or dormitory) → use a "Traditional LAN" for direct connection; **no virtual networking required**;
· To host a server for friends worldwide → use "Internal Network Penetration" to expose the server to the public internet;
· If you don’t want to deal with network settings → choose "Online Mod" or "Official Solution";
· Not sure? Click "Start Recommendation" below and select yes/no step by step.

